Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:37.93,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1473,876,1503,897,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:43.18,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:43.18,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.93,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.93,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:52.58,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:52.58,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:01:01.03,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:01:01.03,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:08.37,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:08.37,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:15.39,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:15.39,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:52.94,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Mo...ther…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:06.48,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?\N Why don't you shoot ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:10.92,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,I said I'd spare both Garmillas and Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:15.14,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HF7FDAB&}What's the meaning of this, Mill ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:23.63,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before taking over your memories and despair\N from the last thousand years, I want to ascertain…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:29.18,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\i1}{hito}…{that }if human desire is truly so weak that it can \Nbe changed through immediate gratification.{benefit.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:34.66,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,I've been created to become the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:38.68,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,My words are Zorder's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:46.58,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Now, young Desler...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.98,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,...choose your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:53.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Shoot, Ranhalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:03:01.09,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Mill is not lying.\N You should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:06.48,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,A man of the Desler family must not hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:12.60,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Obtain what's necessary regardless of the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:42.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Führer…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:43.86,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Don't !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:46.85,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:52.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It's the same test I had to take before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:56.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Whether you pull the trigger or not, \Nyou'll lose something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:03:59.99,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You shouldn't choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:02.73,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The moment when you choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:04.80,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:16.38,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,If you don't choose, what's the point ?!{ else can you do ?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.53,0:04:34.64,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}The enemy's mobile weapons have gone silent !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:38.42,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The assault team must have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:52.98,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:03.63,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,In the end, it's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:08.21,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You're still pulling the trigger, \Nonly now it's{shooting} a different target.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:13.90,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Humans have always chosen to pull the trigger…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:22.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{sousuru}…deceiving ourselves and believing that that's\N the only way to survive or save an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:26.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{kitto}We'll continue pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:32.81,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The debt must be paid by someone…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:38.79,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,…who's capable of doing\Nso when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:48.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I want peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:52.75,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I will surrender to you if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:17.93,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Take this, suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:28.93,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Even if you detonate me,\N it's only going to make a flicker in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:36.48,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You don't understand, do you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:41.38,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Death is not the hardest thing for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:44.13,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{kokonara}No one else will be hurt here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:44.90,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Idiot !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.58,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Don't die alone !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:50.70,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Don't you get it ?!\NThey want a sad ending like this !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:55.35,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You moron, get away ! \NThey'll kill you, too !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.02,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,They might as well do it, then !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:00.93,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{omae}They can't destroy anything !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:06.66,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Not the Yamato, not Earth, \Nnot even one human soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.63,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{dayone}Right, Commander ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.81,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Even someone like me \Ndoesn't have to die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.44,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{sabishiku}You shouldn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.45,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,You shouldn't die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:31.01,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,You have to do everything you\N can to be satisfied before you die.{and \Nshow a satisfied face before you die.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:35.09,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{hito}If you don't die as a human you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.28,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,You're the{a} commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.60,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Don't lose !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.58,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You think you're the first one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:08:01.02,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Every civilization has a \Nperson who thinks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:06.10,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We have a fitting response for those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:12.75,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,If you think of him as your friend,\N don't put him to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:16.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:24.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even so, one side has to choose\N the path of not pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:34.15,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Not pull the trigger ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.38,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,If you could simply do that...{an get by with that...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:43.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...no one would suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.38,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{sentaku}The choice has been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:49.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You'll atone for your decision with your blood !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:06.11,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Yu…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.39,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:16.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:19.75,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Hang{Come} on, Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You're alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:23.69,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.02,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:39.17,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki, why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:46.64,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.08,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I don't know, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:54.49,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,…I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:57.80,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why…?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:02.38,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}She should have lost her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:04.51,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}She doesn't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:09.62,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{marude}It's almost like she's in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:24.22,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\u0\i1}You once said human love is a mere \Nelectrical signal passing through the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:33.01,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\i1}{sore}Humans value it in their heart and soul because \Nthey need its comfort to escape from their misery.{pity.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:42.00,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{\i1}{mada}That's something we haven't\N figured out about humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:56.10,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,The Type Zorder has a superior brain, and it's fated to retain the memories of all previous incarnations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:58.73,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Let's listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.73,0:11:03.70,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,It could be something we've been waiting\N to hear for the last thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:07.35,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,This body may only be a vessel...{be just a container.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:14.98,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,But there's something else. \NIt's none other than a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:18.78,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{sore}And it binds{connects} humans…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:21.33,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{sore}…as strong as gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:22.58,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:29.99,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you must have known this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:36.50,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,The past Zorder models differ slightly, even \Nthough they retain{succeed} all the past memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:42.73,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We Gatlantians are also humans with unique souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:46.78,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We're brought together by fate, and\N live to weave the threads of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:51.08,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,I want to find out the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.00,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We know so little about…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:57.08,def2,MILL{ningen}…humans…and,0,0,0,,...humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.89,def2,MILL{ningen}…humans…and,0,0,0,,...and ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:02.97,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{mada}This is not the time to draw a conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:08.43,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{moshimo}If we can start over…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:15.64,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,If we can look to a different future by freeing\N ourselves from the past thousand years…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:18.08,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,{warera}…then we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:23.44,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,I should choose the \Npath of not pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.18,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,Mill…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:01.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Führer, I'm glad you're safe !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Our fleet's waiting ! Please hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:12.23,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.22,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,This is too foolish.{reword this}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:16.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We had a god-given opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:18.40,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...and we wasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:25.80,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}This war will only end one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:50.39,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Ko…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:15.50,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I wish I could have met him\N under different circumstances.{in a different situation.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.05,0:15:20.41,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,You can't choose fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:27.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I need{want} your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:35.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,This war won't end until one side is annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:46.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even so, all I can do now is to pass on\N the hope that the young Zorder gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.09,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Are you going ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.45,0:16:08.58,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The future of mankind throughout \Nthe universe is at stake in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.22,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I can't turn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:17.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I entrust the future of Garmillas to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:26.64,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Knowing how futile war is, please\N lead our people to a new planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.16,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Tell Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:47.41,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,My Neu Deusular will protect the Yamato from the radiant energy from the transit wave motion gun, so keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:14.19,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why did we fight…?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:21.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why didn't we try to love each other ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.07,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:37.69,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:39.33,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.13,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I just took a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:44.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What do you mean ? Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Don't tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:51.81,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You're Gatlantis's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:59.50,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,This's the only way to cut the\N strings from the puppet, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:02.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,How much were you exposed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:07.03,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I still have one more battle left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:14.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Emergency message from the Mars Garmillas fleet !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:19.00,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}"Warp barrier has been breached, and the \NWhite Comet is advancing toward Earth" !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:38.69,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Earthlings, I have pleasant news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:44.83,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We of Gatlantis will not destroy Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:53.32,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{sono}Because of its value, Earth will\N become a part of the Comet Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:59.68,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{omae}The Time Fault is worthless to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:06.22,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{horobi}It only works effectively when it's\N integrated with the Ark of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:58.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sunlight will no longer shine on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.28,0:21:03.76,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{daichi}The lands and oceans will \Nwill no longer sustain life.{ and decay.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:11.19,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{igo}From now on, you'll be living \Noff of our offerings only.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:18.12,def2,NEWS,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}The Comet Empire has demanded\N unconditional surrender…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:27.19,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Give respect to the great emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.19,0:21:30.23,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Pledge your loyalty if you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:39.12,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Those with beneficial skills will \Nhave the honor of living as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.47,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:47.68,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,Once the Yamato comes back, \Nit can beat them, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:48.53,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,Right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:52.15,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamato…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:53.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{souda}That's right, the Yamato…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.88,0:21:55.50,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,{tokkuni}Wasn't it destroyed already ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{kaimetsu}It's not listed with the lost fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:21:59.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{ikite}It's still operational ? {NOTE: It's faint and optional}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:03.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{souda}That's right. \NWe still have the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:12.61,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,Yamato…
